{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1408648-careful-aim-and-the-sniper-edge","id":1408648,"title":"Careful aim and the Sniper Edge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-16T20:39:58-07:00","id":1408648,"title":"Careful aim and the Sniper Edge","content":"The level two ability for the sniper edge reads, &quot;Double the Enhancement your character would normally gain on an attack for taking the time to carefully aim.&quot; This implies that there is a normal Enhancement that a character would receive when taking the time to aim carefully, but I can't find it. Is this just an Enhancement stunt that you can purchase by rolling an aim carefully action? Or does the edge refer to your weapon's Enhancement? Or is there a set Enhancement for aiming that I'm just not seeing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23589-jimalcoatl","name":"Jimalcoatl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T20:52:29-07:00","id":1408649,"title":"","content":"No, there is no official answer for the \u201caiming carefully\u201d.<br /> <br /> What you may find in the rules is using an enhancement stunt to give enhancements to yourself, as long it\u2019s using another skill. I use this as \u201caiming carefully\u201d, pick an skill that would help you to aim, like science for a long shot, or survival to aim on moving animals or empathy to aim on walking people, and use the extra successes to buy enhanced stunts that grants successes on your next shot, what would be doubled in this condition.<br /> <br /> Another option, that is more house rule than the previous, is to create an Aim skill trick that grants enhancements when you spend an action aiming (that are doubled by the edge).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T22:22:50-07:00","id":1408653,"title":"","content":"Thanks. I thought I might be missing something, the first option is what I was thinking was the most likely answer, more or less, but it would be nice to have special abilities be more clear and less open to interpretation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23589-jimalcoatl","name":"Jimalcoatl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}